{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Adventures is a cozy third-person exploration game where you play as Boris, a curious baby boar who has to learn how to use his nose to reunite his family after a forest fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN THIS DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A glimpse into Boris's life before the fire. He goes exploring with his brother, learns to recognize smells, and gets into mischief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the highlands, find hidden secrets and prepare a new home for the family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006020/extras/f541398783711cea23482b50295b8211.poster.avif?t=1759782500\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006020/extras/f541398783711cea23482b50295b8211.webm?t=1759782500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006020/extras/f541398783711cea23482b50295b8211.mp4?t=1759782500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN THE FULL GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From peaceful forest meadows, rocky highlands, dark caves to sun-dappled paths, use your nose to follow trails, uncover secrets, make friends and expand your library of smells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the forest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and enjoy being in the national park filled with ambient sound and peaceful moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy being a young animal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be adventurous, playful and learn about the forest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A beautifully detailed world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore handcrafted environments with a cozy atmosphere and soothing music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A captivating story told by the Forest Guard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest guard gently guides you as he tells your story based on your actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006020/extras/3e499f4fa328d1e522ff46a67364cdaf.poster.avif?t=1759782500\" width=614 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006020/extras/3e499f4fa328d1e522ff46a67364cdaf.webm?t=1759782500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006020/extras/3e499f4fa328d1e522ff46a67364cdaf.mp4?t=1759782500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a mischievous baby boar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep and innovative scent-tracking mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive herbarium to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your brothers and sisters and other wildlife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of playful activities to compete in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adaptive story told in voice-over\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playful blend of exploration, light platforming and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with care by a small, passionate indie team</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006020?t=1759782500